  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtNRC aims to support people affected by the conflict in receiving inclusive and timely access to basic and life-saving services and assistance,&#xA0;through the provision of basic assistance, WASH, and shelter assistance, in addition to collective site management training.lt/pgtltpgtAs the conflict remains volatile, NRC also plans to utilise part of this grant for preparing for a potential influx in displacement and/or needs.lt/pgt</narrative>
